#. translators: used as a note on the order when Doctor Subs flips it.
msgid ""
"Doctor Subs: marked complete after matching Stripe charge capture on "
"on-hold subscription."
msgstr "Doctor Subs: 보류 중 구독에서 Stripe 결제 승인과 일치하여 완료로 표시됨."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-on-hold-paid.php:198
#. translators: order note on the subscription when Doctor Subs activates it.
msgid "Doctor Subs: flipped to active after matching Stripe-paid renewal."
msgstr "Doctor Subs: Stripe 결제된 갱신과 일치하여 활성으로 전환됨."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-on-hold-paid.php:245
#: includes/rules/class-rule-on-hold-paid.php:256
msgid "Doctor Subs: reverted status change."
msgstr "Doctor Subs: 상태 변경 되돌림."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-on-hold-paid.php:285
#. translators: 1: first name, 2: amount, 3: date
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s's last renewal payment went through in Stripe on <em>%3$s</em> - they "
"were charged %2$s. But the subscription status stayed \"on-hold\" instead "
"of switching back to active."
msgstr ""
"%1$s의 마지막 갱신 결제가 <em>%3$s</em>에 Stripe에서 처리되어 %2$s가 청구되었습니다. 그러나 구독 상태가 "
"활성으로 전환되지 않고 \"보류 중\"으로 유지되었습니다."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-on-hold-paid.php:294
#. translators: %s: first name
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s's last renewal payment went through in Stripe, but the subscription "
"stayed on-hold instead of flipping back to active."
msgstr "%s의 마지막 갱신 결제가 Stripe에서 처리되었지만 구독이 활성으로 전환되지 않고 보류 중 상태로 유지되었습니다."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-repeated-failures.php:139
msgid "Retry payment"
msgstr "결제 재시도"

#: includes/rules/class-rule-repeated-failures.php:140
#. translators: %d: count
#, php-format
msgid "%d failed attempt"
msgid_plural "%d failed attempts"
msgstr[0] "%d 실패한 시도"

#: includes/rules/class-rule-repeated-failures.php:141
#. translators: %s: time
#, php-format
msgid "one retry at %s (UTC)"
msgstr "한 번 재시도 %s (UTC)"

#: includes/rules/class-rule-repeated-failures.php:283
#. translators: 1: first name, 2: count, 3: window days
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Something has been failing to process %1$s's renewal for a while - %2$d "
"failed attempts in the last %3$d days. Worth looking at the card on file or "
"the gateway log."
msgstr ""
"%1$s의 갱신 처리에 문제가 발생하고 있습니다 - 지난 %3$d일 동안 %2$d번 실패했습니다. 카드 정보나 결제 게이트웨이 로그를 "
"확인해 볼 가치가 있습니다."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-repeated-failures.php:292
#. translators: 1: first name, 2: count, 3: window days
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s's renewal has failed %2$d times in the last %3$d days. Often a gateway "
"blip that clears on retry, but worth another look if this retry fails too."
msgstr ""
"%1$s의 갱신이 지난 %3$d일 동안 %2$d번 실패했습니다. 보통 재시도하면 해결되는 게이트웨이 일시적 오류이지만, 이번 재시도도 "
"실패하면 다시 확인할 필요가 있습니다."

#: includes/utilities/class-security.php:32
msgid "Security check failed. Please refresh the page and try again."
msgstr "보안 검증에 실패했습니다. 페이지를 새로고침한 후 다시 시도해 주세요."

#: includes/utilities/class-security.php:45
msgid "You do not have permission to perform this action."
msgstr "이 작업을 수행할 권한이 없습니다."

#: includes/utilities/class-security.php:61
msgid "Invalid subscription ID provided."
msgstr "잘못된 Subscription ID가 제공되었습니다."

#: includes/utilities/class-security.php:114
#. translators: 1: action name, 2: time window in seconds
#, php-format
msgid "Rate limit exceeded for %1$s. Please wait %2$d seconds before trying again."
msgstr "Rate limit exceeded for %1$s. 다시 시도하기 전에 %2$d초 기다려 주세요."
